WEBVTT

00:03:57.765 --> 00:04:00.370
Ammo u, o'z-o'zidan ravshanki, 
ko'zguga boqadi.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.278
Unda Sifengni ko'radi.

00:04:02.278 --> 00:04:03.878
Uning ruhi ko'zguga kiradi

00:04:03.878 --> 00:04:08.715
va oshiq o’lgunicha zanjirband etiladi.
Hamma buddistlar

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:12.372
ham romantik va oshiqona sevgi
haqida bunday fikrda bo'lmagan,

00:04:12.372 --> 00:04:13.985
ammo qissadan hissa shuki,

00:04:13.985 --> 00:04:17.045
bunday his-tuyg'ular fojiaga olib keladi

00:04:17.045 --> 00:04:20.901
va inson sehrli ko'zgu bilan bir qatorda 
sevgidan ham o'zini chetga olishi kerak.

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:24.092
Sevgi o'zligimizni to'laligicha 
namoyon etishga imkon beradi.

00:04:24.092 --> 00:04:26.899
Keling, biroz ko'tarinki ruhda 
so'zimizga yakun yasaymiz.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.048
Fransuz faylasufi
Simona de Bovuarning

00:04:29.048 --> 00:04:32.934
fikricha, sevgi - bu boshqa bir inson 
bilan bir butun bo'lish istagi